  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이전에 했던 열기구 실험자료 올립니다. </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">가스버너 위에 연통을 놓는 것이 어떤 것이냐고 궁금해하시는 듯 해서요.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">열기구안전망이라고 해서 팔아요 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">과학사에 따라 16000원에서 35000원 선에 팔더라구요. </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">버너 위에 그 망을 씌운 후, 열기구를 놓으면 알콜을 직접 태우지 않아도 대류현상으로 올릴 수 있어요. </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">화재 위험이 있으니 이것이 편리하고 또 위로 뜨는 효과도 바로 눈으로 확인하니 좋더라구요. </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">요즘은 안하는데 그전에는 많이 했었어요. ㅋ</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D127%26fileid%3D11%26regdt%3D20180217100600&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile291.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99936F425A877F2730E7C2')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 분자-부피팽창- 열기구.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E0A7445A877E3536\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"480\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"480\" data-filename=\"4726502d884be.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_99E0A7445A877E35360F5E\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DD72445A877E3536\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"640\" data-filename=\"a.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_99DD72445A877E3536F068\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EF63445A877E362B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"659\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"659\" data-filename=\"a.png\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_99EF63445A877E362B6A38\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99667A445A877E3634\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"640\" data-filename=\"b.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_99667A445A877E363456D2\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E16F445A877E3626\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"640\" data-filename=\"c.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_99E16F445A877E36260753\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9918C3445A877E3635\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"640\" data-filename=\"d.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_9918C3445A877E363537C1\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DF5F445A877E3636\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"460\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"460\" data-filename=\"e.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_99DF5F445A877E363667AD\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D278445A877E3701\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"460\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"460\" data-filename=\"f.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_99D278445A877E37015878\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DA01445A877E3732\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"460\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspac